# 12. Important Cleanup

The temporary SSH rule:

```text
EC2-A SG → EC2-B TCP 22
```

was removed.

This was important because it was only a troubleshooting rule.

The final architecture should not allow EC2-A to SSH directly into EC2-B.

Final intended access:

```text
EC2-A → EC2-B :80    ALLOWED
EC2-A → EC2-B :22    DENIED
EICE → EC2-B :22     ALLOWED
```

